00:17:48,300 --> 00:17:49,577
Coordinates confirmed.

260
00:17:49,660 --> 00:17:51,600
Help is on the way. Sounds good.

261
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:53,479
We're heading out.

262
00:17:53,660 --> 00:17:54,740
Let's move. Roger.

263
00:17:55,020 --> 00:17:56,079
I'll drop you off.

264
00:17:57,800 --> 00:17:58,640
Thank you.

265
00:18:06,700 --> 00:18:07,530
Commander!

266
00:18:07,660 --> 00:18:09,200
And Miss Tenka?

267
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:11,360
Shall I stay in assist? No.

268
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:13,718
This area is under our jurisdiction.

269
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:15,548
We'll handle the situation.

270
00:18:16,420 --> 00:18:17,620
Bye. Good luck.

271
00:18:17,980 --> 00:18:21,560
Thank you, Miss Tenka. Let's move. Right.

272
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:27,860
It kind of seems like Miss
Kyoka's in a bad mood.

273
00:18:32,740 --> 00:18:36,757
Listen, I know I said that I wouldn't
interfere in your personal life,

274
00:18:36,840 --> 00:18:38,193
but I'm taking it back.

275
00:18:38,980 --> 00:18:45,860
There will be no more fawning over another
squad's commander at the end of the day.

276
00:18:47,280 --> 00:18:49,360
You are my slave.

277
00:18:50,660 --> 00:18:51,600
