harsher disciplinary methods?

279
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:22,397
Let's beat the shit out of them!

280
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:23,310
Roger!

281
00:19:25,760 --> 00:19:26,590
Oh, wow!

282
00:19:40,780 --> 00:19:42,480
Gotcha! A new type!

283
00:19:44,360 --> 00:19:45,190
Huh.

284
00:19:45,340 --> 00:19:47,046
You don't see that every day.

285
00:19:57,900 --> 00:19:58,900
It's tough!

286
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:00,788
And it regenerates quickly.

287
00:20:02,240 --> 00:20:04,340
Let's finish this! Right!

288
00:20:08,080 --> 00:20:10,000
It's time to bow down!

289
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:18,920
Mighty Blade Cross!

290
00:20:25,780 --> 00:20:28,480
Oh no, they got a minster kill.

291
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:29,940
Augmented Shuuki.

292
00:20:30,260 --> 00:20:33,084
Are good in theory, but
not so good in practice.

293
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:35,060
What are you up to?

294
00:20:35,500 --> 00:20:36,497
Isn't it obvious?

295
00:20:36,580 --> 00:20:38,756
I'm just trying to have a little fun.

296
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:42,557
Humans like combining and
modifying stuff too, don't they?

297
00:20:42,640 --> 00:20:46,464
But I guess having that level of
durability is basically useless.

298
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:50,129
I'll never understand what's
going on in that head of yours.

299
00:20:50,280 --> 00:20:52,700
Now what do you think I should try next?

300
00:20:58,720 --> 00:20:59,550
It's over.

301
00:21:01,260 --> 00:21:02,620
After I transformed,

302
00:21:03,680 --> 00:21:05,440
The things you said to me!

303
00:21:05,620 --> 00:21:06,580
Hype me up!

304
00:21:09,140 --> 00:21:10,000
Oh yeah?

305
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,030
Hmm.

306
00:21:24,280 --> 00:21:25,440
Little slave.

307
00:21:25,840 --> 00:21:28,417
You truly are a slave
at heart, aren't you?

308
00:21:28,500 --> 00:21:30,480
It only makes me want you more.

309
00:21:30,980 --> 00:21:34,804
I don't think my personal life is
going to be as tall from now on

310
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:01,310
Thank you.

311
00:22:46,080 --> 00:22:48,797
Thank you

312
00:22:48,880 --> 00:22:55,880
very

313
00:22:59,240 --> 00:23:00,070
much.

314
00:23:13,940 --> 00:23:14,797
I won't let you go.

315
00:23:14,880 --> 00:23:17,857
I won't let you

316
00:23:17,940 --> 00:23:24,940
go.

317
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:34,177
She's from Shimane Prefecture
and her hobbies include...

318
00:23:34,260 --> 00:23:38,440
We're running out of time, so
next time, Reunion Coco Lick!
